  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the chicken legs with salt and pepper.",
    "Bake the chicken legs in the oven for 25 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Toast the bread slices until lightly browned.",
    "Brush the toasted bread with vegetable oil.",
    "Mix the fish sauce and lime juice in a small bowl.",
    "Brush the mixture onto the toasted bread.",
    "Top the toasted bread with chopped cilantro and scallions.",
    "Serve the chicken legs on top of the toasted bread.",
    "Garnish with additional cilantro and scallions if desired."
